---
import site from '../site.json';
import '../styles/main.css';
const {title=site.pageTitle,description=site.description,robots=site.launchReady?'index,follow':'noindex,follow'}=Astro.props;
const canonical=new URL(Astro.url.pathname,site.url).href;
const schema=JSON.stringify({'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'WebSite',name:'GuideHollow',inLanguage:'ko-KR',url:site.url,description:site.description}).replace(/</g,'\\u003c');
---
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><meta name="robots" content={robots}/>
<link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"/>
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" href="/rss.xml" title="GuideHollow RSS"/>
<meta property="og:locale" content="ko_KR"/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:site_name" content="GuideHollow"/>
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={schema}/>
</head><body style={'--accent:'+site.accent}><a href="#main" class="skip">본문으로 이동</a>
<header class="top"><div class="wrap bar"><a href="/" class="brand"><span class="mark">G</span>GuideHollow</a><nav aria-label="주요 메뉴"><a href="/">홈</a><a href="/guides/">가이드</a><a href="/about/">소개</a><a href="/editorial/">편집 원칙</a></nav></div></header>
<main id="main"><slot/></main>
<footer class="foot"><div class="wrap"><strong>GuideHollow</strong><p>생활 속 문제를 이해하고 직접 점검하는 한국어 안내</p><nav><a href="/privacy/">개인정보 안내</a><a href="/disclosure/">광고·제휴 안내</a><a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a></nav><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} GuideHollow · 공식 기관 또는 제조사 웹사이트가 아닙니다.</small></div></footer>
</body></html>